ckly", "Research more", "Feel guilty", "Rationalize", "Talk to someone"]}, {"id": "platinumlifeidentityrout_18", "type": "choice", "label": "How much do you weigh future people (you’ll never meet) in decisions that affect this topic today?", "options": ["A lot", "Some", "Unsure how to", "Rarely", "Not consciously"]}, {"id": "platinumlifeidentityrout_19", "type": "choice", "label": "When brands or leaders speak on this topic, what erodes your trust fastest?", "options": ["Vague virtue signaling", "Data overreach", "Hypocrisy", "Fear messaging", "Overpromising"]}, {"id": "platinumlifeidentityrout_20", "type": "choice", "label": "If you could only protect one—honesty, kindness, or effectiveness—which do you lean on when they conflict here?", "options": ["Honesty", "Kindness", "Effectiveness", "Refuse to rank", "Situational blend"]}, {"id": "platinumlifeidentityrout_21", "type": "choice", "label": "Do you experience this topic more as a private inner struggle or a public political fight?", "options": ["Mostly private", "More private", "Both equally", "More public", "Mostly public"]}, {"id": "platinumlifeidentityrout_22", "type": "choice", "label": "How often do you update your views based on new evidence vs. doubling down?", "options": ["Update often", "Sometimes update", "Slow to update", "Rarely update", "Depends on the source"]}, {"id": "platinumlifeidentityrout_23", "type": "choice", "label": "Which risk worries you more in this area: being exploited, or missing an opportunity to help?", "options": ["Being exploited", "Missing help", "Both equally", "Neither—different fears", "Not sure"]}, {"id": "platinumlifeidentityrout_24", "type": "choice", "label": "When you feel powerless here, what do you usually do with that feeling?", "options": ["Channel it into action", "Numb or distract", "Talk it through", "Blame systems", "Sit with it quietly"]}, {"id": "platinumlifeidentityrout_25", "type": "choice", "label": "Would you rather be remembered as principled or pragmatic 