ssumption people make about ‘people like you’ in this topic that is often wrong or incomplete."}, {"id": "platinumhealthembodiedna_34", "type": "text", "label": "What is a constructive disagreement you wish more people could have about this—without collapsing into teams?"}, {"id": "platinumhealthembodiedna_35", "type": "text", "label": "If you could ask one question to the most powerful decision-maker in this space, what would it be—and why?"}, {"id": "platinumhealthembodiedna_36", "type": "text", "label": "What would you want researchers to measure that they rarely measure today?"}, {"id": "platinumhealthembodiedna_37", "type": "text", "label": "Describe a time you changed your behavior here—not because you were shamed, but because something clicked."}, {"id": "platinumhealthembodiedna_38", "type": "text", "label": "What is one thing you wish institutions (employers, schools, governments) understood about everyday lived experience here?"}, {"id": "platinumhealthembodiedna_39", "type": "choice", "label": "After reflecting, how clear is your own position on this topic?", "options": ["Very clear", "Somewhat clear", "Mixed", "Uncertain", "Intentionally open"]}, {"id": "platinumhealthembodiedna_40", "type": "choice", "label": "Would you want a close friend to challenge you on this more often, less often, or about the same?", "options": ["More often", "About the same", "Less often", "Depends on how they do it", "Not sure"]}, {"id": "platinumhealthembodiedna_41", "type": "choice", "label": "How likely are you to seek new information on this in the next month?", "options": ["Very likely", "Likely", "Maybe", "Unlikely", "Very unlikely"]}, {"id": "platinumhealthembodiedna_42", "type": "choice", "label": "Do you feel more hopeful, more concerned, or about the same compared to a year ago?", "options": ["More hopeful", "About the same", "More concerned", "Both hopeful and concerned", "I avoid comparing"]}, {"id": "platinumhealthembodiedna_43", "type": "choice", "label": "If you